Third-party data
----------------
This repository does NOT redistribute third-party raw data. Data obtained from
external repositories (NCBI, UniProt, RCSB PDB, Human Protein Atlas, CELLxGENE
Discover, NCBI GEO) remain subject to the terms of their original sources and
are referenced by accession only. See
`00_index_and_metadata/LICENSE_AND_ACCESS.md` for the per-source terms and
accession list.

If you reuse a table in this repository that was derived from a third-party
source, you must also comply with that source's terms and cite the original
publication.
